kindLiftT -- FINISH +=: every kind, one walk, both roads (Tony, 2026-09-25).
A list of count, number, string, Buffer, Stak, an EMPTY field, a field with
MEMBERS and a BIN is walked with `*g += 2`, then a list argument is added onto
an empty field (pick step 4a) and onto a string. The jitted walk (kjList) is
compiled ONCE and fired twice; the interpreted walk (kiList) runs twice on a twin
list. Run with INCANT_KIND_PROBE=1 and INCANT_PEQ_PROBE=1: every fire names the
member that ran (KINDARM) or the opPlusEQ branch that took it (PEQBRANCH), so as
the members land the arms move from branch letters to member names while the
values stay exactly where they are. A Stak cannot print its contents, so its
value is its DEPTH before each fire, read by whichever witness sees it: 0 then 1.
